          "title": "You'll want to know: छंद",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "छंद — chand — \"a hobby\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "माझ्या बहिणीला नाणी गोळा करण्याचा छंद आहे. mājhyā bahiṇīlā nāṇī goḷā karṇyācā chand āhe. My sister's hobby is collecting coins."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The person takes -ला: तिला छंद (chand) आहे."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "छंद (chand) is a tatsama, taken from Sanskrit chanda, \"pleasure, wish\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
