              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "दंग होणे — daṅg hoṇe — \"to be absorbed\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "पुस्तक वाचण्यात अरुण इतका दंग झाला की जेवायला विसरला. pustak vācṇyāt aruṇ itkā daṅg jhālā kī jevāylā visarlā. Arun was so absorbed in his book that he forgot to eat."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (he …): तो खेळात दंग झाला, to kheḷāt daṅg jhālā."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "What absorbs takes -त: खेळात दंग होणे (daṅg hoṇe)."
            }
          ]
        },
